.013700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cmYOg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b9f4a309-2c04-4e25-852f-b55b4a75a2b1","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"補正はかなり面倒くさそうだ","ts":"1616065737.013500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3+B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e7022e01-c437-4af6-aaea-dd2d3c6224fe","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なるほど","ts":"1616065730.013200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vZK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c900385-b484-426e-b0fd-81f99c4fbd30","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"例えば、PHP で `$` と入力すると、LSP の候補として「namespace\\ClassName::$variable」が返ってくるんですが、\nこの場合、この候補を選んだ時に挿入されて欲しいのはおそらく `$variable` だと思うので、それを頑張って抜き出したりしています。","ts":"1616063840.012600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ui9+m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"843095bf-61d0-458d-96b7-893816a9f08c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"LSP はテンポラリな挿入文字列という概念がないので、辻褄が合うような「word 相当の文字列」が頑張って作る必要がでてくる。","ts":"1616063764.011400","edited":{"user":"U8R597E9H","ts":"1616063775.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7NyPP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c4bf91c-f864-404a-bc61-43bb65f9de36","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"vim では頑張ってこの２点を確定しなきゃいけないので、諸々辻褄が合うように変換がいるんですよね。。。","ts":"1616063712.010900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2iS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf89a232-3515-4be9-b5fe-899b7b29daa4","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"VSCode は「補完ウィンドウの表示位置」が常にカーソル位置固定で、さらに「候補を選んだ段階ではバッファは変化しない」というルールになっており、","ts":"1616063684.010300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"whz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5a5d638-13bb-4139-8b54-51fa6c2354e3","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"受信側で加工する前提なので情報を落とせないんだろうけど","ts":"1616063605.009600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tLKhy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3892f78a-8562-460a-bde5-1b81663aec51","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"まともに処理してられない。\nLSPとか生の巨大データを送ってるからね","ts":"1616063585.009000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jm/07"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c4d1b7e-6810-4c66-8710-89db07954840","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"あー、でも確かにdeopleteは長い候補を削ってるな","ts":"1616063564.008300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yXYF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"749dfa2d-8de1-407a-beaf-5e534f2d384f","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"なるほど","ts":"1616063549.007700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YbX7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"461801af-95ab-4e1d-8d10-a44a6ac9db50","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"こういう感じっぽかったので、最大アイテム数を削るようなオプションがあると多少ましになるかもしれない。","ts":"1616063204.007500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eIU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07c18990-b181-41a1-8583-1c6edd3d5ccf","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"パフォーマンス調べた限りでは、\n- LSP 専用の変換 → ちょっと遅い\n- フィルタ・ソート → 結構遅い\n- call complete(...) → かなり遅い","ts":"1616063184.006900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3ZRuO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6dd9bb7-f2e3-4b93-8bc3-652d92bebff1","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"やばすぎますよね。。。流石にレスポンス受信時にカーソルがもたつきます。。。","ts":"1616063126.006100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gRPt"}]},{"c